  "remarks": "LLC Engineering Group develops and produces high-tech equipment and components for various industries. This company represents its partner Belarusian company Izovac in Russia. Izovac was included in the Registry of the Military-Industrial Complex of Russia. Izovac, together with its affiliated companies under the same group name, has supplied Russian defence contractors that have received about USD 200 million worth of goods from Izovac since the beginning of the full-scale Russian invasion of Ukraine. LLC Engineering Group participated as an intermediary. LLC Engineering Group is therefore materially supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex, including by being involved in the development, production or supply of military technology and equipment.",
